7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selection, time-aware projection, bindings, and contract tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrate configuration and time-aware cached display data[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config-and-cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]after window-policy[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-and-cache: integrate Python adapters, schema and defaults, live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config invalidation, documentation, and the Usage Window glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render and verify the compact usage window display[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]compact-display[dim] · [dim][/dim]after window-policy, config-and-cache[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]compact-display: implement icon badges, countdowns, ten-color themes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bounded layout, accessible disclosure, integration tests, and visual [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verification.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-z7","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-z7.3","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-z7.3"},"source_run_id":"run-3788a68f43b615a3e6f747b6df5f45c1","started_at":"2026-09-10T18:21:33.599824+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"bb3e6d0c9bcc0011f9a15f0ad1e0592bf5cac1ed6233d4ebb1c20e47aa723cba","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-z7.3--mon-2/chat.md","size_bytes":103973},"commits":{"digest":"9638b34daefc3fb2cd18753d66c18140469048c71c985dd029c9a97ddb1482ae","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-z7.3--mon-2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"dige